    "text": "thecutoffnews.com\nwebsite\nFayette\nFayette City Council approves hiring of Code Enforcement Officer\n11 hours ago\nThe Fayette City Council held its regular council meeting on Tuesday, Aug. 26. All council members were present for the meeting. Fayette County Commissioner Brad Cox led the council in prayer and his son, Asher Cox, led the Pledge of Allegiance to start the meeting. The minutes of the previous council meeting were unanimously approved by the council.",
